message: "If this work is useful, please cite the paper and repository."
title: "TermGraph: A Certified Glassbox Exchange Architecture for GBM-Class Models"
version: 0.1.4
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AleeeeM2008/termgraph"
authors:
  - family-names: Mery Caro
    given-names: Patricio Alejandro
    email: pmery641@gmail.com
    affiliation: Independent Researcher, La Serena, Chile
keywords:
  - glassbox models
  - explainable artificial intelligence
  - explainable boosting machines
  - SHAP
  - gradient boosting
  - tabular data
abstract: >-
  TermGraph compiles gradient-boosted and explainable-boosting models into a
  certified sum of low-order table terms. It provides exact term-level
  attribution, declared feature sharing, editable terms, compact and
  max-accuracy deployment modes, and a budget controller.
